# A literal directory named "~" at the repository root, created by an unexpanded tilde in a
# past deploy. It was previously ignored only by accident, because the `*~` IDE-swapfile
# pattern happens to match it; this entry makes the exclusion deliberate. `~` has no special
# meaning in gitignore so it needs no escaping, and the leading slash anchors it to the
# repository root so no nested path is affected. The directory is intentionally left on disk.
/~/
